{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"わああああ雪だあああ(´°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥ω°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥｀)感激"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの雪だあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くて寒くて寒くて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのは分かっているが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでそんな雪が好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと北海道や東北の人には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう珍しくないんだろうけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと傘をさしているのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしの髪と洋服には雪が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"積もるんだ〜。なんでよ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたんも焦って走って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転んだりしないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してくださいね(´°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥ω°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪だと大事故になりかねないし。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日のおに魂には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KREVAさんがいらっしゃいました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/02/04/0144381/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く話を聞いていて面白い方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だなーと感じましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非また、リリースの際は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらしてほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でもKREVAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p